{"id":"4340b5682d1ab916","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-torelli-group.md","title":"Torelli Group","display":"df-torelli-group — Torelli Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-torelli-group","aliases":["58-df-torelli-group"],"display":"df-torelli-group — Torelli Group","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-mapping-class-group.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-homology.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-torelli-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-torelli-group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-torelli-group — Torelli Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c77a2d71bd8704e\" href=\"?note=1c77a2d71bd8704e\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-mapping-class-group.md\">../batch10/58-df-mapping-class-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9f6d19a1e737076\" href=\"?note=d9f6d19a1e737076\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-homology.md\">../batch08/58-df-homology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55889258754cb9d9\" href=\"?note=55889258754cb9d9\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md\">../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\omega\">\\(g\\in\\omega\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_g\">\\(\\Sigma_g\\)</span> 是闭、连通、可定向的亏格 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 曲面</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MCG}(\\Sigma_g)\">\\(\\mathrm{MCG}(\\Sigma_g)\\)</span>（映射类群，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1c77a2d71bd8704e\" href=\"?note=1c77a2d71bd8704e\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-mapping-class-group.md\">../batch10/58-df-mapping-class-group.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z)\">\\(H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z)\\)</span>（第一整数同调群，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9f6d19a1e737076\" href=\"?note=d9f6d19a1e737076\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-homology.md\">../batch08/58-df-homology.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle-,-\\rangle_{\\Sigma_g}\">\\(\\langle-,-\\rangle_{\\Sigma_g}\\)</span>（同调上的代数交叉配对）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_{H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z)}\\in\\operatorname{Aut}(H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z))\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_{H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z)}\\in\\operatorname{Aut}(H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_g:\\mathrm{MCG}(\\Sigma_g)\\to\\mathrm{Sp}(H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z),\\langle-,-\\rangle_{\\Sigma_g})\">\\(\\rho_g:\\mathrm{MCG}(\\Sigma_g)\\to\\mathrm{Sp}(H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z),\\langle-,-\\rangle_{\\Sigma_g})\\)</span>（自然同调表示）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I_g\\subseteq\\mathrm{MCG}(\\Sigma_g)\">\\(\\mathcal I_g\\subseteq\\mathrm{MCG}(\\Sigma_g)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}torelli\\text{-}representation}\\vdash \\rho_g:\\mathrm{MCG}(\\Sigma_g)\\to\\mathrm{Sp}(H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z),\\langle-,-\\rangle_{\\Sigma_g}),\\qquad [f]\\longmapsto f_*\\upharpoonright H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}torelli\\text{-}representation}\\vdash \\rho_g:\\mathrm{MCG}(\\Sigma_g)\\to\\mathrm{Sp}(H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z),\\langle-,-\\rangle_{\\Sigma_g}),\\qquad [f]\\longmapsto f_*\\upharpoonright H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}torelli\\text{-}group}\\vdash \\mathcal I_g\\coloneqq\\ker(\\rho_g)=\\bigl\\{[f]\\in\\mathrm{MCG}(\\Sigma_g):f_*\\upharpoonright H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z)=\\mathrm{id}_{H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z)}\\bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}torelli\\text{-}group}\\vdash \\mathcal I_g\\coloneqq\\ker(\\rho_g)=\\bigl\\{[f]\\in\\mathrm{MCG}(\\Sigma_g):f_*\\upharpoonright H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z)=\\mathrm{id}_{H_1(\\Sigma_g;\\mathbb Z)}\\bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Torelli 群由在第一整数同调上作用平凡的映射类组成。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\ge 3\">\\(g\\ge 3\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I_g\">\\(\\mathcal I_g\\)</span> 有限生成，这是 Johnson 的定理，不属于本定义。</li>\n<li>Johnson 核是 Johnson 同态的核；它不应在定义中无条件等同于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\mathcal I_g,\\mathcal I_g]\">\\([\\mathcal I_g,\\mathcal I_g]\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-mapping-class-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c77a2d71bd8704e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-mapping-class-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-homology.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9f6d19a1e737076","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-homology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md","status":"resolved","id":"55889258754cb9d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df